  "title": "Numbers, age & quantities",
  "goal": "Count things and people, ask how much and how many, give your age and use ordinals from first to tenth.",
  "intro": "First learn the numbers from the **Numbers** chart: 1–10 are essential, and the teens are irregular (పదకొండు 11, పన్నెండు 12, పదిహేను 15). From 20 on the system is regular: tens + units, ఇరవై ఒకటి (21), ముప్పై ఐదు (35).\n\nTelugu has a special set of numbers for **counting people**: *ఇద్దరు* (two people), *ముగ్గురు* (three people). And it distinguishes *ఎంత* (how much) from *ఎన్ని* (how many).",
